    "detail": [
      [
        {
          "icon": "empty",
          "icon_lead": true
        },
        {
          "ink": "muted",
          "text": "A part is one ability of radar, usually one tool it works with, compiled in as a cargo feature. Parts never depend on each other: each works alone, and each one present adds to the others."
